### Test Tenant Service Endpoints

### 1. Create a new tenant
POST http://localhost:3001/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinicName": "Dr. Smith Family Clinic",
  "subdomain": "dr-smith-clinic",
  "contactEmail": "admin@drsmithclinic.co.zw",
  "contactPhone": "+263771234567",
  "address": "123 Medical Drive, Harare",
  "city": "Harare",
  "subscriptionTier": "professional"
}

### 2. Get all tenants
GET http://localhost:3001/tenants

### 3. Get tenant by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/tenants/{{tenant_id}}

### 4. Get tenant by subdomain
GET http://localhost:3001/tenants/subdomain/dr-smith-clinic

### 5. Update tenant status
PUT http://localhost:3001/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}

### 6. Check tenant health
GET http://localhost:3001/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/health

### 7. Delete tenant (use with caution)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/tenants/{{tenant_id}}

